Cell["\<\
Neither does equating the highest power of q or all powers of q gives a real \
solution of p other than p=1, so the the replica symmetry is explicitly \
broken.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.870144715013406*^9, 3.8701447976035433`*^9}, {
  3.870171759043511*^9, 3.8701717902915573`*^9}, {3.870171871267277*^9, 
  3.8701718757947273`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"30fbd4a7-dcd5-4a91-bf30-\
cb72b54f035e"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Ising couplings as functions of the quantum circuit parameters\
